 "overview": "Your 7 days Italy and France honeymoon package tour will take you to explore the relics of the Roman Empire and witness the serene charm of Vatican City. Stand amidst the great monuments of history from once upon a time, soaking in the beautiful designs and the beauty they radiate.Enjoy walking around the mesmerizing backdrop of Italy, hand in hand with your loved one. The artistic culture, gorgeous surroundings and architecture of Italy will leave you both stunned and in awe of each moment that you spend together in this European wonder. Watch the sunset from the Bell Tower in Florence, take a moment to marvel at the Florence Cathedral and find yourself wanting to live forever in one moment at a riverside cafe, enjoying dinner with a beautiful view all around you.You both will be witnessing the stunning architecture of the Leaning Tower of Pisa and the breathtaking Tuscan fields and streams in the countryside. Next on your tour of Europe will be Paris - the capital city of France. A fascinating culture of art, food, and fashion woven together in one of the world's most charming cities with France honeymoon tour.The sight of the Eiffel Tower is breathtaking, and followed by cruising on the Sienna River. Visit the childhood favourite of everyone, Disneyland in Paris and meet some fascinating friends from Disney World. The entire experience of cruising on Sienna, revisiting Roman history, strolling through the beautiful streets of Italy and France, and creating memories in the two most romantic countries of Europe is unforgettable.",
